        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Imbono zya-Egepita, azisambalo zya-Etiopiya, aba-Seba bantu balamfu, zyoonse ziyooinda kulindinywe, ziyooba zyanu. Bayoomutobela, bayooinda balaangidwe ankeetani akumukotamina. Bayoomukombelezya cakwaamba kuti, Leza uli kulindinywe luzutu, alimwi taakwe umbi, taakwe ba-Leza bambi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
