            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teendakaamba kumbali munyika yamudima. Teendakaambila lunyungu lwa-Jakebo kuti, Amundiyandaule munyika yalupilingano, Mebo nde-Jehova ndaamba bululami, ndamulwiida makani aalomene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.19",
