              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulungulule, mulete makani. Babuzyanye makani antoomwe. Nguni wakaamba aya makani kalekale? Nguni wakaaluula kukutaanguna P Sa teensi ndime nde-Jehova? Taakwe Leza umbi uutali ndime, Leza uululeme, Mufutuli. Taakwe umbi kunze kwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amusandulukile kulindime, mukafutuke, numagolelo oonse aanyika, nkaambo ndime Leza, taakwe umbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
