        {
          "text": "Ndakonka kuzina lyangu ndemwini. Ijwi lyazwa mukanwa lyangu mubululami, nkabela talikooyooboola pe. Ncobeni mazwi oonse ayoofugamina ndime, andimi zyoonse ziyookonkela ndime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.23",
